  "minute": 55.0,
  "event_seq": 102,
  "root_problem": "Billing dispute tickets roughly doubled since August 2026 (E-03) because a change to the billing import validation rules around that time is the best-supported locus of systematic bill-calculation errors, consistent with tariff changes being ruled out (E-04) and with the majority (59%, 1785/3025) of disputed bills being billed from ACTUAL meter reads rather than estimates (E-05), i.e. the defect affects both read paths, not just estimate substitution. This is a bill-correctness problem in the billing-import step, not a ticket-handling capacity shortfall, since dispute response times remain inside the 3.0-day SLA (E-02)."
 },
